{"id":57907,"date":"2026-08-08T15:04:37","date_gmt":"2026-08-08T14:04:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=57907"},"modified":"2026-10-01T22:49:30","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T21:49:30","slug":"maratona-de-dublin","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-dublin\/","title":{"rendered":"Irish Life Maratona de Dublin 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Irish Life Maratona de Dublin 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Irish Life Maratona de Dublin 2026<\/strong> (45\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) \u00e9 uma das maratonas mais prestigiadas, emblem\u00e1ticas e acolhedoras de todo o continente europeu, celebrando mais de quatro d\u00e9cadas de tradi\u00e7\u00e3o atl\u00e9tica no domingo, <strong>25 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, nas avenidas hist\u00f3ricas da capital da <strong>Irlanda<\/strong>. Famosa mundialmente como a maratona mais calorosa devido ao apoio entusi\u00e1stico e incans\u00e1vel do p\u00fablico irland\u00eas ao longo de todo o tra\u00e7ado, a prova inicia-se na requintada <strong>Fitzwilliam Street Upper<\/strong> e culmina na c\u00e9lebre <strong>Merrion Square North<\/strong>, reunindo mais de 22.000 maratonistas de dezenas de nacionalidades.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com a dist\u00e2ncia cl\u00e1ssica oficial de <strong>42,195 km<\/strong> sobre piso de asfalto plano e r\u00e1pido com certifica\u00e7\u00e3o World Athletics, o percurso guia os atletas atrav\u00e9s das paisagens deslumbrantes do <strong>Phoenix Park<\/strong>, contorna o ic\u00f3nico Rio Liffey e atravessa a rica arquitetura georgiana do centro de <strong>Dublin<\/strong>. A largada organiza-se em quatro vagas espa\u00e7adas por ritmo competitivo, oferecendo abastecimentos a cada 5 km, zonas de hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o isot\u00f3nica, medalha comemorativa gravada e um ambiente de consagra\u00e7\u00e3o \u00fanico.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/stron